                                "sense_id": "3a95aa66-055f-308b-8cd2-8af268ca1fe8",
                                "text": "These monster-swarms his Holiness and his helly crew have scraped and raked together out of old doting historiographers, wizardising augurs, imposturing soothsayers, dreaming poets, chimerical conceiters, and coiners of fables, […]."
