                                "sense_id": "3a95aa66-055f-308b-8cd2-8af268ca1fe8",
                                "text": "Then wavered all the rebel rings, And of a sudden, ere a single blow Was struck, precipitous they shrieking fled, And sought the portals of their Helly home."
